# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and on checkout on every
# platform. The build job runs on windows-latest; without this, C# sources
# and test fixtures were checked out with CRLF there, which made raw-string
# fixtures and "\n"-based assertions behave differently from macOS/Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Real-world corpus files are kept byte-exact (one of them is CRLF on purpose).
tests/EdsDcfNet.Tests/Fixtures/Corpus/** -text

# Binary files
*.snk binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
